WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.472
At last Bat knew what to do.

2
00:00:08.473 --> 00:00:20.940
He flew back to Cow.

3
00:00:20.941 --> 00:00:24.303
"I am brown," said Bat.

4
00:00:24.304 --> 00:00:26.557
"Just like you."

5
00:00:26.558 --> 00:00:30.244
"Oh!" said Cow.

6
00:00:30.245 --> 00:00:39.015
"Then I can be your friend!"

7
00:00:39.016 --> 00:00:43.621
Bat flew to Pig.

8
00:00:43.622 --> 00:00:45.486
"I like to eat.

9
00:00:45.487 --> 00:00:51.036
Just like you," said Bat.

10
00:00:51.037 --> 00:00:53.573
"Oh!" said Pig.

11
00:00:53.574 --> 00:00:57.297
"Then I can be your friend!"

12
00:00:57.298 --> 00:01:03.364
Bat flew to Cat.

13
00:01:03.365 --> 00:01:07.903
"I like to sleep," said Bat.

14
00:01:07.904 --> 00:01:11.052
"Just like you."

15
00:01:11.053 --> 00:01:13.811
"Oh!" said Cat.

16
00:01:13.812 --> 00:01:21.820
"Then I can be your friend."

17
00:01:21.821 --> 00:01:26.652
Bat was happy.

18
00:01:26.653 --> 00:01:41.943
He flew round and round.

19
00:01:41.944 --> 00:01:45.462
"I like it here!" he said.

20
00:01:45.463 --> 00:01:56.257
"Welcome to the barn!" said Cow and Cat and Pig.

21
00:01:56.258 --> 00:02:01.862
Bat had three new friends.

22
00:02:01.863 --> 00:02:07.875
Bat had a new home.

